WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,140 --> 00:00:01,040
not me

2
00:00:01,140 --> 00:00:02,180
really not me

3
00:00:04,290 --> 00:00:05,730
Pretending to be like a little white rabbit

4
00:00:06,050 --> 00:00:07,450
Why are you so scheming when you speak?

5
00:00:07,690 --> 00:00:09,370
She specially called Aunt Meng to come to Jinshi

6
00:00:09,930 --> 00:00:11,410
Just to embarrass Mei Ke today

7
00:00:11,810 --> 00:00:13,540
How did Mei Ke offend her?

8
00:00:13,540 --> 00:00:15,140
In order to clear my name in front of my brother,

9
00:00:15,140 --> 00:00:16,860
He even resorted to such a sinister trick.

10
00:00:16,860 --> 00:00:18,060
Meeting this kind of best friend

11
00:00:18,060 --> 00:00:19,620
It can be considered that I have spent eight lifetimes clearing minefields.

12
00:00:19,900 --> 00:00:21,700
Coco, you believe me

13
00:00:21,900 --> 00:00:23,420
I really just want aunty to be with you

14
00:00:23,420 --> 00:00:24,700
I did this to make peace

15
00:00:25,100 --> 00:00:27,180
I really want to apologize to you

16
00:00:27,580 --> 00:00:31,450
I really can't think of Jingyi

17
00:00:31,970 --> 00:00:34,010
I thought you sincerely reconciled with me today

18
00:00:34,290 --> 00:00:35,370
I'm really happy

19
00:00:35,370 --> 00:00:37,330
I thought our relationship was indestructible

20
00:00:38,010 --> 00:00:41,700
Really disappointed me

21
00:00:42,020 --> 00:00:42,940
from now on

22
00:00:42,940 --> 00:00:44,460
we will never be friends again

23
00:00:46,890 --> 00:00:50,020
Mom, let’s go, okay?

24
00:00:50,420 --> 00:00:51,540
I haven't scolded you enough yet

25
00:00:53,100 --> 00:00:54,740
Okay, mom will take you away

26
00:00:56,660 --> 00:00:58,300
What did they mean when I heard them just now?

27
00:00:58,540 --> 00:00:59,980
My daughter saved you, right?

28
00:01:00,260 --> 00:01:02,060
But you don't say thank you to her

29
00:01:02,300 --> 00:01:03,500
You shouldn't help others either

30
00:01:03,500 --> 00:01:04,980
This is how you humiliate my daughter

31
00:01:06,420 --> 00:01:09,660
I'm sorry for disturbing your banquet today.

32
00:01:10,190 --> 00:01:13,510
But I, Meng Xilan, admit that I have many faults

33
00:01:13,950 --> 00:01:16,110
Maybe not a good person in the worldly sense

34
00:01:16,550 --> 00:01:19,070
But this is not the reason for you to see my daughter clearly

35
00:01:19,710 --> 00:01:21,790
My Mick is the most honest and kind-hearted person.

36
00:01:22,030 --> 00:01:23,830
The villages are different. It's normal that we can't play together.

37
00:01:23,950 --> 00:01:25,070
But if you let me know

38
00:01:25,190 --> 00:01:27,190
You are smearing my daughter because of my affairs

39
00:01:27,390 --> 00:01:36,660
You want face, I have no shame, you guys

40
00:01:36,860 --> 00:01:40,530
I know you won't believe me no matter what. Now that's the case

41
00:01:40,650 --> 00:01:42,330
I'm not here to love everyone's eyes either

42
00:01:42,610 --> 00:01:44,170
Please give me your phone back

43
00:01:44,450 --> 00:01:48,610
The ghost is obsessed with believing Song Jingyi's lies

44
00:01:48,850 --> 00:01:50,730
I think Mick has ulterior motives in approaching me.

45
00:01:50,890 --> 00:01:52,370
I wanted to thank her properly

46
00:01:52,490 --> 00:01:54,250
Add WeChat and become friends later
